<div class="admin-main__header"><h1>Settings</h1></div>

<section class="card">
  <% cj_configured = current_store&.supplier_settings&.values_at("api_key", "access_token")&.any?(&:present?) ||
    ENV["CJ_API_KEY"].present? ||
    ENV["CJ_ACCESS_TOKEN"].present? ||
    Rails.application.credentials.dig(:cj, :api_key).present? ||
    Rails.application.credentials.dig(:cj, :access_token).present? %>
  <p>Secrets are read from Rails credentials or environment variables.</p>
  <p><strong>Stripe configured:</strong> <%= Stripe.api_key.present? %></p>
  <p><strong>CJ configured:</strong> <%= cj_configured %></p>
</section>
